OL,5,G1700 Cyprus: Jewel of the Med
OL,6,     FWe visit stunning Cyprus. With 11
OL,7,     Fmonths of sunshine, beautiful
OL,8,     Fbeaches and crystal-clear waters,
OL,9,     Fit's no wonder this former
OL,10,     Fplayground for the reek Gods
OL,11,     Fattracts four million visitors a
OL,12,     Fyear.
OL,13,G1800 Abandoned Engineering
OL,14,     FWe discover a concrete dome, that
OL,15,     Fwas once intended to conceal and
OL,16,     Fprotect Hitler's terrible wonder
OL,17,     Fweapons, and a mysterious building
OL,18,     Fwith eerie echoes of the Cold War.
