OL,5,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,6,     FDocumentary series. Ben travels to
OL,7,     FAustralia's north west cape to
OL,8,     Fmeet two people, compelled by
OL,9,     Ftragedy, to turn their backs on
OL,10,     Ftheir former lifestyles.
OL,11,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,12,     FDocumentary series. Ben meets a
OL,13,     Fcouple who have made their home on
OL,14,     Fa floating island they have built
OL,15,     Fthemselves which sits in the aptly
OL,16,     Fnamed Freedom Cove.
OL,17,G2100 Taggart
OL,18,     FKaren Lennox is found electrocuted
OL,19,     Fin what appears to be a lightning
OL,20,     Fstrike, but then another body
OL,21,     Fturns up and the team begin
OL,22,     Flooking for a murderer.
