OL,5,G2305 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FThe play presents a complete
OL,7,     Fcharacter assassination of all the
OL,8,     Fofficers and staff. Doreen makes a
OL,9,     Fcake for Lizzie's Christmas gift,
OL,10,     Fsoaked in alcohol, which Vera
OL,11,     Fconfiscates.
OL,12,G0010 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FFollowing David's escape, Pat is
OL,14,     Fbothered by a horde of reporters.
OL,15,     FShe gets a message to meet David
OL,16,     Fat his hideout and encourages him
OL,17,     Fto give himself up. But a gunfight
OL,18,     Ffollows.
